		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4007&amp;p=31009#p31009"><![CDATA[
<blockquote class="uncited"><div>To select the Voice, APRS or Beacon fequency, press the keys 1, 2 or 3 respectively.</div></blockquote>This image which I had posted is just when I press the key 2 on the PO-101 frenquency screen.<br><br><div class="inline-attachment"><dl class="file"><dt class="attach-image"><img src="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=2386&amp;sid=a7bff629d15a4dfbbdd4491df97d26a0" class="postimage" alt="PO-101 APRS.jpg" onclick="viewableArea(this);" /></dt></dl></div><br>After I set the TX2 (APRS) freq of PO-101 as <strong class="text-strong"><em class="text-italics"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="color:#FF0040">437.500</span></span></em></strong> like EC2UT [<a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewtopic.php?f=12&amp;t=3940&amp;start=4" class="postlink">viewtopic.php?f=12&amp;t=3940&amp;start=4</a>], the above screen is displayed APRS TX freq as <strong class="text-strong"><em class="text-italics"><span style="color:#0040FF">145.900</span></em></strong> (the same as RX freq), that is the  <strong class="text-strong"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="color:#FF0000">bug / problem</span></span></strong>.<br><br><div class="inline-attachment"><dl class="file"><dt class="attach-image"><img src="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=2387&amp;sid=a7bff629d15a4dfbbdd4491df97d26a0" class="postimage" alt="EC2UT.jpg" onclick="viewableArea(this);" /></dt></dl></div><blockquote class="uncited"><div>The APRS Mode (from the Options submenu) has nothing to do with the Satellite's APRS.</div></blockquote><br>Since VK3KYY [<a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewtopic.php?f=12&amp;t=3940&amp;start=7" class="postlink">viewtopic.php?f=12&amp;t=3940&amp;start=7</a>] said that APRS mode in APRS option, I just pay attention that and changed it.<br><br><div class="inline-attachment"><dl class="file"><dt class="attach-image"><img src="http://localhost/opengd77/download/file.php?id=2388&amp;sid=a7bff629d15a4dfbbdd4491df97d26a0" class="postimage" alt="VK3KYY.jpg" onclick="viewableArea(this);" /></dt></dl></div><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5469">BD4SMY</a> — Thu Apr 25, 2024 1:21 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
