		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4007&amp;p=31006#p31006"><![CDATA[
The APRS Mode (from the Options submenu) has nothing to do with the Satellite's APRS.<br>Once in Satellite screen, APRS auto beaconing is disabled.<br>In Satellite screen, when you select the "APRS" mode, it uses APRS frequency from the keps, and you have to press PTT to xmit a beacon.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Wed Apr 24, 2024 3:54 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
